The existing phase, closer, audit, registration and administrative algorithms
are invoked without mathematical changes. The new science preparation adapter
separates the accepted science peer from the new metadata peer. The new API
adapter authenticates the actual new cooperative entry, exact command, Root
intent and all raw frames. Aggregate, registration and administrative checks
retain the explicit original/effective binding record. False first-v1 summary
fields stay false when a setup-failure transition is present.

Standalone metadata histories admit one to eight editions. Every nonzero prior
attempt is authenticated at its own exact argv/SDK/raw frames and must name
the same supplement program, packet, operation and logical cohort/batch/phase.
A separate positive Root reconciliation owns the retained frames, partial
outputs, absence of scientific calls and refusal to replay completed work.
Successful prior attempts, different Source packets/programs and mismatched
logical identities are rejected. There is no profiler ``--`` assumption for
these calls. Old genuinely profiled initialization/preparation histories use
their original adapter and remain separate from this standalone route, and
both remain separate from the scientific resource-binding transition.

Registration alone may publish the two fixed intake/controller targets. It
reuses the existing raw-value preservation algorithm, writes all fresh stage
images first, checks both complete frozen beforeimages again before the first
replacement, and serially replaces the two pointers. Runtime is a fresh stage
image selected by controller. This requires Root's sole-writer ownership and
an independent actual aggregate review. It is not a multi-file atomicity or
filesystem-quota claim. No manuscript, conjecture, census or compression credit
is obtained by a binding transition or metadata control.

The synthetic controls exercise actual pure production predicates on toy
metadata. They do not authenticate genuine SDKs, prove filesystem absence,
exercise the whole authority chain, run numerical predicates or demonstrate
atomic publication. Genuine Root metadata calls and their independent actual
reviews remain required. A resource/deadline stop may produce no output.

Source namespaces count every loaded Python body, including unchanged helpers,
but not science/guard bodies merely read as evidence and never executed here.
Three complete namespaces prepay bootstrap/module rereads. The child Ledger
meters first/closing data reads, and planned/late-CAS reads are charged again.
All active inputs are whole hashed and closed before fresh writes. This is a
bounded local operation contract, not a bound on other host processes.
